# ProjectP (D.O.G) - Portfolio Code Repository
# 코드/설정/문서만 관리한다. 언리얼 에셋(Content), 빌드 산출물, 바이너리는 제외.
###############################################################################

# --- 언리얼 에셋 / 대용량 (7.1GB) ---
Content/
SourceAssets/
Data/Texture/

# --- 언리얼 빌드 산출물 ---
Binaries/
Intermediate/
Saved/
DerivedDataCache/
